# fix: align BoxArray decomposition in terrain initialization
#
# static_ba.maxSize(512) created a box decomposition misaligned with
# AMR level 0, causing ParallelCopy's spatial lookup to place averaged
# values at wrong physical positions. Removing the hardcoded maxSize
# fixes the alignment.
#
# Fixes #42
